Package: BayesMFRM
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Many-Facet Rasch Models using Stan
Version: 0.1.0.9008
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Jane", "Doe",
      email = "jane@example.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: An R package for Bayesian many-facet Rasch models (RSM and PCM) using Stan
    (via cmdstanr). Provides an interface for fitting multi-facet models with hierarchical
    facets, partial credit steps, and two-way bias interactions with local shrinkage, along
    with structural design-identifiability checks, prior and posterior predictive checks,
    FACETS-style fit and fair-score diagnostics, unified posterior prediction, and
    target-aware model comparison (PSIS-LOO and K-fold cross-validation).
